---
const owner = {
    name: "Bolesław Stopa",
    role: "Właściciel Stabilnego Najmu",
    // Uzupełnij te dane w gotowym landingu:
    companyName: "[NAZWA FIRMY]",
    nip: "[NIP]",
    phone: "510 159 125",
    email: "[E-MAIL]",
};
---

<section id="about-me" class="about-me">
    <div class="section-container about-me-grid">
        <div class="about-me-photo-wrapper">
            <img
                src="/images/bolek-stopa.jpg"
                alt="Bolesław Stopa — właściciel Stabilnego Najmu"
                class="about-me-photo"
                loading="lazy"
            />
        </div>

        <div class="about-me-copy">
            <span class="about-me-tag">KTO ZA TYM STOI</span>
            <h2 class="about-me-title">{owner.name}</h2>
            <p class="about-me-role">{owner.role}</p>

            <div class="about-me-text">
                <p>Nazywam się <strong>Bolesław Stopa</strong> i&nbsp;to ja odpowiadam za Stabilny Najem. Wiem z&nbsp;doświadczenia, ile czasu i&nbsp;nerwów potrafi zjeść właścicielowi wynajem — dlatego biorę to na siebie.</p>
                <p>Nie robię tego sam: mam ludzi od odświeżania mieszkań, obsługi najemców i&nbsp;bieżących spraw, więc wszystko dzieje się sprawnie i&nbsp;na czas.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="about-me-info">
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Firma</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{owner.companyName}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">NIP</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{owner.nip}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">Telefon</span>
                    <a class="info-value info-link" href="tel:+48510159125">{owner.phone}</a>
                </div>
                <div class="info-row">
                    <span class="info-label">E-mail</span>
                    <span class="info-value">{owner.email}</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    .about-me {
        background-color: var(--color-background);
        padding-block: var(--px-112);
    }

    .about-me-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr;
        gap: var(--px-80);
        align-items: center;
        max-width: 90rem;
        margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .about-me-photo-wrapper {
        aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-lg);
        background: var(--color-white);
    }

    .about-me-photo {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
        display: block;
    }

    .about-me-tag {
        display: inline-block;
        font-size: var(--text-xs);
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.15em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--color-accent);
        margin-bottom: var(--px-16);
    }

    .about-me-title {
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 2.75rem);
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--color-primary);
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
        margin-bottom: var(--px-6);
    }

    .about-me-role {
        font-size: var(--text-lg);
        color: var(--color-text-secondary);
        margin-bottom: var(--px-32);
    }

    .about-me-text {
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: var(--px-16);
        font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.35vw, 1.15rem);
        line-height: 1.75;
        color: var(--color-text-dark);
        margin-bottom: var(--px-40);
    }

    .about-me-text p {
        opacity: 0.92;
    }

    .about-me-text strong {
        color: var(--color-primary);
        font-weight: 700;
    }

    .about-me-info {
        display: grid;
        gap: var(--px-14);
        padding: var(--px-24) var(--px-28);
        background: var(--color-white);
        border-radius: var(--radius-md);
        border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
    }

    .info-row {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 6rem 1fr;
        gap: var(--px-16);
        align-items: baseline;
    }

    .info-label {
        font-size: var(--text-xs);
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.1em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    }

    .info-value {
        font-size: var(--text-base);
        color: var(--color-text-primary);
        font-weight: 500;
    }

    .info-link {
        color: var(--color-primary);
        transition: color var(--transition-short);
    }

    @media (hover: hover) and (pointer: fine) {
        .info-link:hover {
            color: var(--color-accent);
        }
    }

    @media screen and (max-width: 64rem) {
        .about-me-grid {
            grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            gap: var(--px-48);
        }

        .about-me-photo-wrapper {
            max-width: 26rem;
            margin-inline: auto;
        }
    }

    @media screen and (max-width: 48rem) {
        .about-me {
            padding-block: var(--px-80);
        }

        .info-row {
            grid-template-columns: 5rem 1fr;
        }
    }
</style>
